{"id":"P076-2","subject":"P","unit":"P076","unitTitle":"2025 ① (1월~4월) · 25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P076-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n전기자 저항이 0.5Ω인 직류 분권전동기의 정격전압이\n\n100V, 정격전류가 20A , 정격회전속도가 900rpm이\n\n다. 이 전동기의 무부하 회전속도는 몇 rpm인가?\n\n\n① 950         ② 1000\n\n③ 1050         ④ 1100\n\n⑤ 1150","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e09-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":663},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1076},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m26-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1319}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P076-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n200kVA 변압기 2대를 병렬운전하는 경우, 각각의\n\n%임피던스가 3와 5일 때, 공급 가능한 최대부하\n\n용량은 몇 kVA 인가?\n\n\n① 320         ② 340\n\n③ 360         ④ 380\n\n⑤ 400","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e09-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":565},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m27-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1300}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P076-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n그림과 같은 반지름이 0.2m인 원의 점과 점사이에\n2A의 전류가 흐를 때, 점에서의 자계는 몇 Am인\n\n가?\n\n\n\n\n\n                           \n①            ②  \n\n                           \n③            ④  \n\n    \n⑤  ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e09-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":878},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":584},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m28-e2.webp","width":696,"height":592}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P076-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n동기발전기의 병렬운전에서 한 발전기의 계자전류를 변화\n\n시켰을 때 나타나는 현상은?\n\n\n① 주파수가 감소된다.\n\n② 역률이 개선된다.\n\n③ 유효순환전류가 흐른다.\n\n④ 무효순환전류가 흐른다.\n\n⑤ 고조파 무효전환전류가 흐른다.","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e09-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":482},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1292}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P076-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n3000kVA, 정격전압 3000V인 동기발전기에서 퍼센트\n\n임피던스가 50일 때, 동기발전기의 동기 임피던스Ω\n\n와 단락비의 값은?\n\n\n\n    동기 임피던스Ω       단락비\n\n ①           1.5                 2\n\n ②          3                  2\n\n ③           1.5                 5\n\n ④          3                  5\n\n ⑤           1.5                 10","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e09-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":707},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":869}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P076-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n슬립 5로 운전중인 3상 유도전동기에 인가되는 전압이\n\n20감소 할 때, 전부하슬립은 몇 인가?\n\n\n                            \n①            ②      \n\n                         \n③            ④       \n\n    \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p1","collectionLabel":"2025 ① (1월~4월)","examLabel":"25.04.19 대구교통공사 (한국사회능력개발원)","originalId":"2025p1-e09-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":656},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p1-e09-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1013}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":""